{41}{Well, basically, we're instructed to warn everyone about the dangers of that maze which lies ahead through those gates with that stupid poem or whatever it is, but I always forget how it goes... Anyway, a lot of foolish people have gone through those gates, and never returned. It's rumored to be full of ugly monsters and such. Never been there myself though...}{Well, basically, we're instructed to warn everyone about the dangers of that maze which lies ahead through those gates with that stupid poem or whatever it is, but I always forget how it goes... Anyway, a lot of foolish people have gone through those gates, and never returned. It's rumored to be full of ugly monsters and such. Never been there myself though...}{}{}{}{}
{42}{Wait a minute.. Is this "The Maddening Forest"?}{}{5}{qu1004 2}{61}{}
{43}{Hmm. Right. I'm going there just for fun... May I enter?}{}{5}{qu1004 0}{81}{}

{61}{But of course! Why do you ask, sir?}{But of course! Why do you ask, ma'am?}{}{}{}{}
{62}{I'm supposed to get something from there.... May I enter?}{}{5}{}{81}{}

{81}{Sure, but we're not coming to pick up your rotting corpse, in case you happen to be killed by those evil monsters lurking about there.. I think I should give you this... [He hands you a lightweight broadsword and two charged rings.] They are from the last poor soul who died just before he had gotten past the gates. He was all chewed out by the evil monsters. By the way, I've heard there's a humongous treasure hidden somewhere in the forest.}{Sure, but we're not coming to pick up your rotting corpse, in case you happen to be killed by those evil monsters lurking about there.. I think I should give you this... [He hands you a lightweight broadsword and two charged rings.] They are from the last poor soul who died just before he had gotten past the gates. He was all chewed out by the evil monsters. By the way, I've heard there's a humongous treasure hidden somewhere in the forest.}{}{}{}{in -3003, in -3002, in -2201}
{82}{Thanks! Now I can laugh at the danger ahead.. I'll see you later, guards..}{}{5}{}{}{fl 101}


{101}{Not unless you get killed, sir. Farewell.}{Not unless you get killed, ma'am. Farewell.}{}{}{}{}

{121}{Hmmm. Not so smart, eh? [Thinks for a moment.] If you go to that forest, you may die. Understand? It's dangerous out there. Here, take some equipment. [He gives you a powerful looking sword and a couple of strange rings.] They were leftovers from the last poor soul who died on his way back from the forest.}{Hmmm. Not so smart, eh? [Thinks for a moment.] If you go to that forest, you may die. Understand? It's dangerous out there. Here, take some equipment. [He gives you a powerful looking sword and a couple of strange rings.] They were leftovers from the last poor soul who died on his way back from the forest.}{}{}{}{in -3003, in -3002, in -2201}
